      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نفّض</span></b> , (S, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْفِيضٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He
shook</i> a garment, or piece of cloth, and a tree,
<i>much,</i> or <i>vehemently, in order that what was upon
it might fall off.</i> (S, TA. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Said of a horse,
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَّضَ</span>, q. v. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رفض</span>.)

